# Migration skill auto-invoke (DBS-FFW)

**Read** from prompt intent even if user does not name skill/path — do not skip before implement.

## Baseline / bulk (Wave 0–3)

**Triggers (EN/MM):** bulk, baseline, scaffold, wire, wired, တန်းပြောင်း, အားလုံး, all pages, all web parts, re-scaffold, inventory sync, baseline wave

Naming one page or WP (`Ffw`, `index.aspx`, `PastEvents`, …) is **not** bulk — use parity / one-slice below (or Ambiguous if mode unclear).

1. Read `.cursor/skills/bulk-classic-to-spfx-baseline/SKILL.md`
2. Sync `docs/migration/PARITY.md` ↔ repo-root `progress.md`
3. Scope = **multiple live routes** OK in one wave
4. Status = **wired / baseline** only — **no parity PASS** claim
5. Rule `18-bulk-migration-baseline.mdc` constraints apply

## Parity / visual (Wave 4 · one slice)

**Triggers:** parity, visual, pixel, classic match, classic နဲ့, spacing, hover, font, **font-weight**, **font weight**, **ထူ**, **ပါး**, **bold**, **underline**, OpenSans, breakpoint, visual QA, parity PASS

1. Read `.cursor/skills/classic-to-spfx-migration/SKILL.md`
2. Then `classic-visual-parity` → **[visual-typography.md](../skills/classic-to-spfx-migration/references/visual-typography.md) (typography self-check — required)** → `uikit-to-spfx-visual-parity` (UI tasks)
3. Scope = **one web part / one classic page** — bulk parity reject
4. Status = **parity PASS** only after visual checklist

## Swiper / carousel (functional + visual)

**Triggers:** swiper, carousel, slider, gallery slider, winner-slider, swiper-button, slidesPerView, gallery swipe, winner slide

1. Read `.cursor/skills/swiper-to-spfx-carousel/SKILL.md` (+ `references/classic-configs.md` if wiring init)
2. Load `classic-visual-parity` for nav button / slide CSS (not vendor bundle CSS)
3. `npm i swiper` = user approval first
4. Scope = one slice or one slider section — not site-wide dep without ask

## SPFx scaffold / data (any migration)

**Triggers:** web part, SPFx, gulp, manifest, serve.json, list, PnP, SPHttpClient

→ Read `.cursor/skills/spfx/SKILL.md` (+ `references/` only if needed)

## Ambiguous

**Examples:** "spfx ပြောင်းပေး", "migrate classic", "classic → SPFx" (mode unclear). A single name like "Ffw" without bulk words → one-slice, not bulk.

→ Clarify-first **one question:** baseline bulk (wire all) vs parity slice (one WP polish)?  
→ User confirms → load matching skill above. Do not guess parity vs baseline.

## Always (migration)

- `.cursor/rules/17-classic-host-and-assets.mdc` — one WP per classic page; **no hub pageKey router**
- Pins: SPFx 1.20 · gulp · React 17 · Fluent v8 · no Heft/v9 · deps ask-first

